ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}A mí no me preguntes, yo de arte
sé tanto como de alta costura.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}"Le belle arti"... Ma, scusa, perché?
Ci sono anche le... brutte arti?
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ich hab gehört, hier hing mal ein
Bild mehrere Wochen auf dem Kopf,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
und niemand hat's gemerkt!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Before I knew it, this place got
itself a decent collection going!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I'm impressed!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Poco a poco{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} se han hecho con una
colección de arte bastante decente,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
¿no crees?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Estoy impresionado!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Cavoli, questa collezione è cresciuta
senza che me ne accorgessi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Un po' come le mie unghie!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}So langsam kann sich diese
Sammlung sehen lassen!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Akzeptabel.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben farkına varmadan burası düzgün
bir koleksiyon toplamış!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Etkilendim doğrusu!

IT:
Tra questa e quella della tua città,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
qual è la migliore collezione
di opere d'arte?

TRANSLATION:
Senin kasabayla burası arasında,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}sence hangisinin sanat koleksiyonu daha iyi?
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Evet, katılıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bizimki herhâlde.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Our collection here is pretty darn
complete, don't you think?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}At this rate,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} we'll have a complete
collection in a matter of days!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I just gotta paint a bit!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tenemos una colección
muy completica, ¿eh?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}A este paso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no dejaremos ni
un solo cuadro para los demás.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}On a déjà une belle collection, qu'en
penses-tu ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}À ce rythme,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} elle sera complète
dans quelques jours !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}La nostra collezione è praticamente
completa! {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Se si va di questo passo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
arriveremo al 100% tra pochi giorni!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quasi quasi resto qui dentro
per fare il conto alla rovescia!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bizim koleksiyon epey tamamlanmış, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bu
gidişle{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} birkaç güne her
şeyi toplarız!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir de benim iki fırça sallamam yeter!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
What's the art collection {{TAG:0003:0017:}}like in your
town? Is it this nice?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Not to brag or anything, but our
town's collection is perfect!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
¿Qué tal es la colección de arte
del museo de tu pueblo?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Es {{TAG:0003:0017:}}así de completa?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}No es por presumir y tal,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
pero nuestra colección es
PERFECTA.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
Come siete messi nella tua città
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}in fatto di opere d'arte?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Noi modestamente siamo messi
parecchio bene!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
Und, {{TAG:0003:0017:}}ist die Kunstsammlung in
deiner Stadt besser als unsere?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich glaube kaum. {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Perfektion
kann man nicht überbieten!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}BWA HA HA HA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
Senin kasabandaki sanat koleksiyonu
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}nasıl? Bunun kadar iyi mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Övünmek
gibi olmasın ama bizim kasabanın
koleksiyonu kusursuz!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
